{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["等价无穷小", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "由展开式\n$$\n\\sin x=x-\\frac{x^3}{6}+o(x^3),\\qquad \\sin3x=3x-\\frac{(3x)^3}{6}+o(x^3)\n$$\n可得\n$$\n3\\sin x-\\sin3x\n=3\\left(x-\\frac{x^3}{6}\\right)-\\left(3x-\\frac{27x^3}{6}\\right)+o(x^3)\n=4x^3+o(x^3).\n$$\n故 $k=3,\\ c=4$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数定义", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "因为 $f$ 在 $0$ 处可导，且 $f(0)=0$，所以\n$$\nf(x)=f'(0)x+o(x),\\qquad f(x^3)=f'(0)x^3+o(x^3).\n$$\n于是\n$$\nx^2f(x)-2f(x^3)=f'(0)x^3-2f'(0)x^3+o(x^3)=-f'(0)x^3+o(x^3).\n$$\n因此极限为 $-f'(0)$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["驻点", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "在定义域内\n$$\nf'(x)=\\frac{1}{x-1}+\\frac{1}{x-2}+\\frac{1}{x-3}.\n$$\n令 $f'(x)=0$，化简得\n$$\n3x^2-12x+11=0.\n$$\n其判别式为 $12>0$，有两个不等实根，并且都落在函数定义域内，所以驻点有 $2$ 个。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数线性微分方程", "特解形式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "对应齐次方程的特征方程为\n$$\nr^2-\\lambda^2=0,\n$$\n特征根为 $\\pm\\lambda$。右端 $e^{\\lambda x},e^{-\\lambda x}$ 都与齐次解共振，各需乘以 $x$，故特解应取\n$$\ny_p=x(ae^{\\lambda x}+be^{-\\lambda x}).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二元函数极值", "充分条件"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "在 $(0,0)$ 附近作二阶展开：\n$$\nz=f(x)g(y)=f(0)g(0)+\\frac12 f''(0)g(0)x^2+\\frac12 f(0)g''(0)y^2+o(x^2+y^2).\n$$\n要使 $(0,0)$ 成为极小值点，二次项系数应都为正。由于 $f(0)>0,g(0)<0$，故应有\n$$\nf''(0)g(0)>0\\Rightarrow f''(0)<0,\n$$\n$$\nf(0)g''(0)>0\\Rightarrow g''(0)>0.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分比较", "对数函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "在 $0<x<\\dfrac\\pi4$ 上，有\n$$\n0<\\sin x<\\cos x<1.\n$$\n取对数后得\n$$\n\\ln(\\sin x)<\\ln(\\cos x)<0,\n$$\n积分可知 $I<K<0$。又\n$$\nJ=\\int_0^{\\pi/4}[\\ln(\\cos x)-\\ln(\\sin x)]dx=K-I>0.\n$$\n故\n$$\nI<K<J.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["初等变换", "矩阵乘法"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "将第 $2$ 列加到第 $1$ 列，等价于右乘矩阵 $P_1$，故\n$$\nB=AP_1.\n$$\n再交换 $B$ 的第 $2,3$ 行得到单位矩阵，等价于左乘 $P_2$，即\n$$\nP_2B=I.\n$$\n代入得\n$$\nP_2AP_1=I\\Rightarrow A=P_2^{-1}P_1^{-1}=P_2P_1^{-1}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["伴随矩阵", "零空间"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "由 $Ax=0$ 的基础解系为 $(1,0,1,0)^T$，知\n$$\n\\alpha_1+\\alpha_3=0,\n$$\n故 $r(A)=3$。于是 $r(A^*)=1$，从而 $A^*x=0$ 的解空间维数为 $3$。  \n又由恒等式\n$$\nA^*A=O\n$$\n知 $A$ 的列向量都属于 $A^*x=0$ 的解空间，因此该解空间就是 $A$ 的列空间。由于 $\\alpha_3=-\\alpha_1$，列空间的一组基可取 $\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3,\\alpha_4$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "指数极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\sqrt2$", "explanation": "设极限为 $L$，取对数：\n$$\n\\ln L=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{1}{x}\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+2^x}{2}\\right).\n$$\n由 $2^x=e^{x\\ln2}=1+x\\ln2+o(x)$，得\n$$\n\\frac{1+2^x}{2}=1+\\frac{x\\ln2}{2}+o(x).\n$$\n因此\n$$\n\\ln L=\\frac{\\ln2}{2},\n$$\n从而\n$$\nL=e^{(\\ln2)/2}=\\sqrt2.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["一阶线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$e^{-x}\\sin x$", "explanation": "乘以积分因子 $e^x$，得\n$$\n(e^xy)'=\\cos x.\n$$\n积分可得\n$$\ne^xy=\\sin x+C.\n$$\n由 $y(0)=0$ 知 $C=0$，故\n$$\ny=e^{-x}\\sin x.\n$$", "methods": ["积分因子"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["弧长", "积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)$", "explanation": "有\n$$\ny'=\\tan x,\n$$\n故弧长\n$$\ns=\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\sqrt{1+(y')^2}\\,dx=\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\sec x\\,dx.\n$$\n积分得\n$$\ns=\\left.\\ln|\\sec x+\\tan x|\\right|_0^{\\pi/4}=\\ln(1+\\sqrt2).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["广义积分", "概率密度"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{\\lambda}$", "explanation": "由定义可知\n$$\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}xf(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^{+\\infty}x\\lambda e^{-\\lambda x}\\,dx.\n$$\n分部积分或利用指数分布的期望公式，得\n$$\n\\int_0^{+\\infty}x\\lambda e^{-\\lambda x}\\,dx=\\frac{1}{\\lambda}.\n$$", "methods": ["分部积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "平面区域"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{7}{12}$", "explanation": "圆可写成\n$$\nx^2+(y-1)^2=1.\n$$\n区域由 $x=0$、$y=x$ 和上半圆弧围成，可取积分次序\n$$\n0\\le x\\le1,\\qquad x\\le y\\le1+\\sqrt{1-x^2}.\n$$\n因此\n$$\n\\iint_D xy\\,d\\sigma\n=\\int_0^1\\int_x^{1+\\sqrt{1-x^2}}xy\\,dy\\,dx\n=\\int_0^1 x\\left(1+\\sqrt{1-x^2}-x^2\\right)dx\n=\\frac14+\\frac13=\\frac{7}{12}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["二次型", "惯性指数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$2$", "explanation": "对应矩阵为\n$$\nA=\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&1&1\\\\\n1&3&1\\\\\n1&1&1\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n其顺序主子式为\n$$\n\\Delta_1=1>0,\\qquad \\Delta_2=2>0,\\qquad \\Delta_3=0.\n$$\n再注意到矩阵秩为 $2$，且非零特征值均为正，因此二次型有两个正平方项、一个零平方项，故正惯性指数为 $2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "定积分函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$1<\\alpha<3$", "explanation": "先看 $x\\to0^+$。由\n$$\n\\ln(1+t^2)\\sim t^2\n$$\n得\n$$\n\\int_0^x\\ln(1+t^2)dt\\sim\\int_0^x t^2dt=\\frac{x^3}{3}.\n$$\n故\n$$\nF(x)\\sim\\frac{x^3/3}{x^\\alpha}=\\frac13x^{3-\\alpha},\n$$\n要使极限为 $0$，需\n$$\n3-\\alpha>0\\Rightarrow \\alpha<3.\n$$\n再看 $x\\to+\\infty$。当 $t$ 大时，$\\ln(1+t^2)\\sim2\\ln t$，从而\n$$\n\\int_0^x\\ln(1+t^2)dt\\sim 2x\\ln x.\n$$\n因此\n$$\nF(x)\\sim 2x^{1-\\alpha}\\ln x.\n$$\n要使其趋于 $0$，需\n$$\n\\alpha>1.\n$$\n综上\n$$\n1<\\alpha<3.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数方程", "极值", "凹凸性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "极大值为 $1$（在点 $(-1,1)$ 处），极小值为 $-\\dfrac13$（在点 $\\left(\\dfrac53,-\\dfrac13\\right)$ 处）；当 $x<\\dfrac13$ 时曲线凹向下，当 $x>\\dfrac13$ 时曲线凹向上；拐点为 $\\left(\\dfrac13,\\dfrac13\\right)$。", "explanation": "有\n$$\n\\frac{dx}{dt}=t^2+1>0,\n$$\n故 $x$ 关于 $t$ 单调增加。于是\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt}=\\frac{t^2-1}{t^2+1}.\n$$\n令 $\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=0$，得 $t=\\pm1$。代入参数方程：\n$$\nt=-1\\Rightarrow (x,y)=(-1,1),\n$$\n$$\nt=1\\Rightarrow \\left(x,y\\right)=\\left(\\frac53,-\\frac13\\right).\n$$\n又\n$$\n\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac{\\dfrac{d}{dt}\\left(\\dfrac{t^2-1}{t^2+1}\\right)}{dx/dt}\n=\\frac{4t}{(t^2+1)^3}.\n$$\n故当 $t<0$ 时 $\\dfrac{d^2y}{dx^2}<0$，曲线凹向下；当 $t>0$ 时 $\\dfrac{d^2y}{dx^2}>0$，曲线凹向上。  \n由 $t=0$ 时\n$$\nx=y=\\frac13,\n$$\n知拐点为 $\\left(\\dfrac13,\\dfrac13\\right)$。", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["复合函数", "二阶偏导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$f_u(1,1)+f_{uu}(1,1)+f_{uv}(1,1)$", "explanation": "记\n$$\nu=xy,\\qquad v=yg(x),\n$$\n则\n$$\nz=f(u,v).\n$$\n先对 $x$ 求偏导：\n$$\nz_x=f_u\\,u_x+f_v\\,v_x=yf_u+y g'(x)f_v.\n$$\n再对 $y$ 求偏导：\n$$\nz_{xy}=f_u+y(xf_{uu}+g(x)f_{uv})+g'(x)f_v+y g'(x)(x f_{uv}+g(x)f_{vv}).\n$$\n由于 $g$ 在 $x=1$ 处取极值且可导，所以\n$$\ng(1)=1,\\qquad g'(1)=0.\n$$\n在 $(x,y)=(1,1)$ 处代入，且此时 $(u,v)=(1,1)$，得到\n$$\nz_{xy}(1,1)=f_u(1,1)+f_{uu}(1,1)+f_{uv}(1,1).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "切线倾角"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$\\displaystyle y=\\arcsin\\!\\left(\\frac{e^x}{\\sqrt2}\\right)-\\frac\\pi4$", "explanation": "设\n$$\np=y'.\n$$\n因为切线倾角 $\\alpha=\\arctan p$，故\n$$\n\\frac{d\\alpha}{dx}=\\frac{p'}{1+p^2}.\n$$\n题设给出\n$$\n\\frac{p'}{1+p^2}=p,\n$$\n即\n$$\np'=p(1+p^2).\n$$\n又曲线与直线 $y=x$ 相切于原点，所以\n$$\ny(0)=0,\\qquad p(0)=1.\n$$\n分离变量：\n$$\n\\int\\frac{dp}{p(1+p^2)}=\\int dx.\n$$\n积分得\n$$\n\\ln p-\\frac12\\ln(1+p^2)=x+C.\n$$\n由 $p(0)=1$ 可得 $C=-\\dfrac12\\ln2$，化简得\n$$\n\\frac{p}{\\sqrt{1+p^2}}=\\frac{e^x}{\\sqrt2}.\n$$\n故\n$$\np=y'=\\frac{e^x}{\\sqrt{2-e^{2x}}}.\n$$\n于是\n$$\ny=\\int \\frac{e^x}{\\sqrt{2-e^{2x}}}\\,dx\n=\\arcsin\\left(\\frac{e^x}{\\sqrt2}\\right)+C_1.\n$$\n再由 $y(0)=0$ 得\n$$\nC_1=-\\frac\\pi4.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不等式证明", "数列收敛"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "结论成立，数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 收敛。", "explanation": "(I) 由函数 $\\dfrac1x$ 在区间 $[n,n+1]$ 上单调递减，\n$$\n\\frac1{n+1}<\\int_n^{n+1}\\frac{1}{x}\\,dx<\\frac1n.\n$$\n而\n$$\n\\int_n^{n+1}\\frac1x\\,dx=\\ln\\left(1+\\frac1n\\right),\n$$\n故结论成立。  \n(II) 考察差分：\n$$\na_{n+1}-a_n=\\frac1{n+1}-\\ln\\left(1+\\frac1n\\right).\n$$\n由 (I) 知\n$$\n\\frac1{n+1}-\\ln\\left(1+\\frac1n\\right)<0,\n$$\n故 $\\{a_n\\}$ 单调递减。又由\n$$\n\\ln n=\\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}\\ln\\left(1+\\frac1k\\right)<\\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}\\frac1k,\n$$\n得\n$$\na_n=\\left(1+\\frac12+\\cdots+\\frac1{n-1}\\right)-\\ln n+\\frac1n>0.\n$$\n因此 $\\{a_n\\}$ 有下界且单调递减，所以收敛。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["旋转体", "定积分应用", "做功"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/q020_diagram.png"], "answer": "(I) $V=\\dfrac{9\\pi}{4}$；  \n(II) $W=3375\\pi g$。", "explanation": "旋转半径满足\n$$\nr^2=\n\\begin{cases}\n1-y^2,&-1\\le y\\le \\dfrac12,\\\\\n2y-y^2,&\\dfrac12\\le y\\le2.\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n(I) 容积\n$$\nV=\\pi\\int_{-1}^{1/2}(1-y^2)dy+\\pi\\int_{1/2}^{2}(2y-y^2)dy\n=\\frac{9\\pi}{4}.\n$$\n(II) 把高度为 $y$ 处的薄层水抽到顶部 $y=2$，需提升距离 $2-y$。故做功\n$$\nW=10^3 g\\pi\\int_{-1}^{1/2}(2-y)(1-y^2)dy\n+10^3 g\\pi\\int_{1/2}^{2}(2-y)(2y-y^2)dy.\n$$\n计算得\n$$\n\\int_{-1}^{1/2}(2-y)(1-y^2)dy+\\int_{1/2}^{2}(2-y)(2y-y^2)dy=\\frac{27}{8},\n$$\n所以\n$$\nW=10^3g\\pi\\cdot\\frac{27}{8}=3375\\pi g.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "$I=a$", "explanation": "对 $x$ 分部积分：\n$$\nI=\\int_0^1 y\\,dy\\int_0^1 x f_{xy}(x,y)\\,dx\n=\\int_0^1 y\\left([xf_y(x,y)]_0^1-\\int_0^1 f_y(x,y)dx\\right)dy.\n$$\n由于 $f(1,y)=0$，所以 $f_y(1,y)=0$，故\n$$\nI=-\\int_0^1 y\\,dy\\int_0^1 f_y(x,y)dx.\n$$\n交换积分次序并对 $y$ 再分部积分：\n$$\nI=-\\int_0^1 dx\\int_0^1 y f_y(x,y)dy\n=-\\int_0^1 dx\\left([yf(x,y)]_0^1-\\int_0^1 f(x,y)dy\\right).\n$$\n又因 $f(x,1)=0$，于是\n$$\nI=\\int_0^1dx\\int_0^1 f(x,y)dy=\\iint_D f(x,y)dxdy=a.\n$$", "methods": ["分部积分", "交换积分次序"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["向量组", "线性表示"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "(I) $a=5$；  \n(II)\n$$\n\\beta_1=2\\alpha_1+4\\alpha_2-\\alpha_3,\\qquad\n\\beta_2=\\alpha_1+2\\alpha_2,\\qquad\n\\beta_3=5\\alpha_1+10\\alpha_2-2\\alpha_3.\n$$", "explanation": "(I) 若 $\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\beta_3$ 线性无关，则它们张成 $\\mathbb R^3$，任意三维向量组都能由它们线性表示，这与题意矛盾。因此\n$$\n\\det(\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\beta_3)=0.\n$$\n计算\n$$\n\\det\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&1&3\\\\\n1&2&4\\\\\n1&3&a\n\\end{pmatrix}\n=a-5,\n$$\n故\n$$\na=5.\n$$\n(II) 设\n$$\n(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3)\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&1\\\\\n0&1&3\\\\\n1&1&5\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n分别解线性方程组\n$$\nc_1\\alpha_1+c_2\\alpha_2+c_3\\alpha_3=\\beta_i\n$$\n即可得到\n$$\n\\beta_1=2\\alpha_1+4\\alpha_2-\\alpha_3,\n$$\n$$\n\\beta_2=\\alpha_1+2\\alpha_2,\n$$\n$$\n\\beta_3=5\\alpha_1+10\\alpha_2-2\\alpha_3.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011_q023", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2011", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2011, "question_number": 23, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["实对称矩阵", "特征值", "矩阵求解"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2011_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2011_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q023.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "(I) 特征值为 $-1,0,1$，对应特征向量可分别取\n$$\n(1,0,-1)^T,\\ (0,1,0)^T,\\ (1,0,1)^T.\n$$\n(II)\n$$\nA=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0&0&1\\\\\n0&0&0\\\\\n1&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "explanation": "设\n$$\nu_1=(1,0,-1)^T,\\qquad u_2=(1,0,1)^T.\n$$\n由题设矩阵等式知\n$$\nAu_1=-u_1,\\qquad Au_2=u_2,\n$$\n故 $-1,1$ 是 $A$ 的两个特征值，特征向量分别为 $u_1,u_2$。  \n又因 $r(A)=2$，所以 $0$ 也是特征值。由于 $A$ 为实对称矩阵，不同特征值对应的特征向量互相正交，故与 $u_1,u_2$ 都正交的特征向量可取\n$$\nu_3=(0,1,0)^T.\n$$\n于是\n$$\nA=P\\operatorname{diag}(-1,0,1)P^{-1},\n$$\n其中 $P$ 的列向量取为 $u_1,u_3,u_2$。也可直接利用谱分解：\n$$\nA=-\\frac{u_1u_1^T}{u_1^Tu_1}+\\frac{u_2u_2^T}{u_2^Tu_2}.\n$$\n计算得\n$$\nA=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0&0&1\\\\\n0&0&0\\\\\n1&0&0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "methods": []}
